 (Of course, every room already has its own desk and chair 😅)
 
+## Turning the 5th-floor room next to the kitchen into a study room with a loft bed
+
 So we renovated the room on the 5th floor next to the kitchen — previously used as a bedroom — into a study room.  
 We could have just bought a new desk and called it done, but we wanted to keep the room as open as possible while still having a bed on hand for emergencies, so we decided to build a tall loft bed instead. We made it to fit the room's exact dimensions.
 
